  "description": "*“In Joseon, people spend half the year hunting tigers and the other half attending funerals for those killed by tigers.”*\n\nIn Joseon, the land of tigers, a tiger-hunting unit called the “Chakho-gapsa” is on the rise! Song Seol, a tenacious underdog who has been second place for years and runs relentlessly toward his goal, Kang Yun-Jo, the training academy's perennial top student, blessed with exceptional athletic talent. A sports romance unfolds as these two men with completely different personalities meet at the “Tiger Hunter Training Academy” and become roommates.\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
